WEBVTT

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:16.530
Souta.

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:21.820
Oneesan.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:24.740
You're on vacation.

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:26.900
Why not go talk to a girl?

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:29.490
No one wants to talk to me.

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:32.050
I'd rather just take a nap here.

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:36.940
A hat?

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:44.220
Thank you.

00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:49.150
So, who are you?

00:00:49.910 --> 00:00:51.010
Me?

00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:53.280
I'm Sakura.

00:00:53.630 --> 00:00:54.670
Sakura.

00:00:55.710 --> 00:00:57.820
Hey, would you like to

00:00:58.510 --> 00:00:59.700
play a game with me?

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:01.380
A game?

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:18.220
<b>If Her Flag Breaks</b>

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:42.010
<b>Flag 2</b>

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:42.010
<b>Girls are in the Dorm. 
But I can't say it yet. Wait Until Tomorrow.</b>

00:02:50.010 --> 00:02:51.480
Good morning, Nanami.

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:54.440
Leave me alone, you perv.

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:56.570
I already explained that.

00:02:55.470 --> 00:02:56.170
Hmph.

00:02:57.140 --> 00:03:00.400
I needed to do something to 
overwrite her death flag.

00:03:00.850 --> 00:03:03.160
Hmph. Like I believe that.

00:03:04.390 --> 00:03:05.660
Souta-kun.

00:03:06.020 --> 00:03:07.990
H-Hi...

00:03:07.990 --> 00:03:09.930
Good morning.

00:03:10.470 --> 00:03:11.920
Oh, hi.

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:15.560
Akane, you should be more careful around

00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:19.010
a perv who'd kiss a defenseless girl.

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:20.940
W-Well...

00:03:20.940 --> 00:03:22.480
If Souta-kun wants to be a perv,

00:03:22.880 --> 00:03:26.470
he should have just said so!

00:03:29.550 --> 00:03:30.640
Don't break her flag!

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:33.980
You shouldn't just 
brush people off, okay?

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:35.060
I know.

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:39.320
<i>I can't break her conquest flag, anyway.</i>

00:03:43.340 --> 00:03:44.290
Sou-kun!

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:44.820
Huh?

00:03:46.550 --> 00:03:47.490
Is that you,

00:03:48.130 --> 00:03:49.300
Okiku-nee?

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:50.910
I knew it was you!

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:52.500
It's Sou-kun!

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:55.300
Sou-kun!

00:03:56.960 --> 00:04:00.260
You're alive. You're alive!

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:02.420
It's the real Sou-kun, right?

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:05.220
H-Hey, wait.

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:06.810
She tackled him!

00:04:06.810 --> 00:04:08.070
Are they a couple, or something?!

00:04:08.070 --> 00:04:09.350
Why is she on top of him?

00:04:09.350 --> 00:04:12.130
I was worried about you this whole time!

00:04:12.130 --> 00:04:13.850
I couldn't get a hold of you.

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:16.790
Your mom and dad...

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:18.450
Yeah...

00:04:18.450 --> 00:04:20.040
Also Oneesan...

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:23.160
Oneesan? You're an only 
child, aren't you?

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:24.480
I see...

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:27.030
I guess you don't remember, either.

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:30.450
Hey! What are you two doing?!

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:34.520
No! No!

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:36.300
I've known Sou-kun since we were kids!

00:04:36.300 --> 00:04:37.330
Since you were kids?

00:04:37.600 --> 00:04:39.850
Sou-kun transferred 
away in middle school,

00:04:39.850 --> 00:04:41.060
and I haven't seen him in two years!

00:04:41.060 --> 00:04:43.340
He's gotten so big!

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:46.840
Why are you in this class when you 
should be with the second-years?

00:04:47.070 --> 00:04:50.510
Well, last year, I was studying overseas,

00:04:50.510 --> 00:04:52.850
so I ended up a year behind.

00:04:53.390 --> 00:04:56.400
This was my seat! Right next to Sou-kun!

00:04:56.400 --> 00:05:00.050
I didn't think he'd transfer 
away while I was out sick!

00:05:00.050 --> 00:05:01.330
What a troublemaker.

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:02.400
R-Right...

00:05:02.620 --> 00:05:03.240
Huh?

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:06.030
<b>Kiku's Eye</b>

00:05:03.620 --> 00:05:06.030
Sou-kun, you look like you're warn out.

00:05:07.760 --> 00:05:10.500
You can sleep on my lap 
and I'll clean your ears.

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:12.070
You liked that, didn't you?

00:05:12.070 --> 00:05:13.550
I'm sure that'll make you feel better.

00:05:13.550 --> 00:05:14.830
W-Wait...

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:16.200
She's being too nice to him!

00:05:16.200 --> 00:05:16.990
She's spoiling him!

00:05:16.990 --> 00:05:18.210
She's an older sister type!

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:24.410
This is terrible! Terrible!

00:05:24.410 --> 00:05:27.450
This is where you're living?

00:05:27.450 --> 00:05:29.720
You just feel terrible 
for Sou-kun, don't you?

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:31.020
Not you, too, Akane.

00:05:31.020 --> 00:05:33.030
You already knew he was living here.

00:05:33.030 --> 00:05:36.120
Kikuno-senpai started crying,

00:05:36.120 --> 00:05:38.100
so I started crying, too...

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:41.360
Akane-chan, so you're 
crying for Sou-kun, too!

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:44.220
When did Akane-chan and Nanami-chan

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:46.030
<b>Kiku's Eye</b>

00:05:44.220 --> 00:05:46.610
get so close to Sou-kun?!

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:47.360
Huh?

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:51.360
Sou-kun is spending time with other girls, 
and he kept them secret from me...

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:53.040
That can't be...

00:05:53.870 --> 00:05:56.080
O-Okiku-nee...

00:05:59.180 --> 00:06:00.130
She went crazy!

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:01.910
Onee-chan's happy!

00:06:01.910 --> 00:06:02.440
Huh?

00:06:02.440 --> 00:06:05.130
I mean, Akane-chan and Nanami-chan, 
you're both good girls.

00:06:05.570 --> 00:06:07.590
I approve!

00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:10.130
Take good care of Sou-kun.

00:06:10.130 --> 00:06:11.510
R-Right!

00:06:11.740 --> 00:06:14.430
I'll take care of him with Nanami-chan!

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:15.750
Why me, too?!

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:16.930
Hey, Souta!

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:18.520
Don't just stand there! Say something!

00:06:18.820 --> 00:06:22.570
I'm actually happy the two 
of them are getting along.

00:06:22.570 --> 00:06:23.420
So what's the problem?

00:06:23.420 --> 00:06:26.280
Don't sacrifice me for their friendship!

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:29.950
<b>Kiku's Eye</b>

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:29.950
Sou-kun looks so lonely...

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:31.430
It's okay, Sou-kun!

00:06:31.430 --> 00:06:35.670
I'll make sure both of them 
stay good friends with you!

00:06:35.670 --> 00:06:36.450
On, no!

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:39.750
I can't believe I let 
Souta-kun become lonely!

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:41.830
I'm a failure of a friend!

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:44.430
If we stay like this, 
we can all be friends!

00:06:44.430 --> 00:06:45.020
Hey.

00:06:45.020 --> 00:06:46.460
So what are we going to do?

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:50.270
What's going on?!

00:06:50.270 --> 00:06:51.590
Is this some kind of dark art?!

00:06:58.350 --> 00:06:59.770
So that's when I...

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:04.140
Souta, does Kikuno have a flag, too?

00:07:04.140 --> 00:07:05.140
Yeah...

00:07:05.540 --> 00:07:07.530
That's the sibling love flag.

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:08.530
I see.

00:07:08.800 --> 00:07:11.980
So that's what makes 
her act like this.

00:07:12.810 --> 00:07:14.910
Try breaking her sister flag.

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:16.800
You told me not to break 
them this morning.

00:07:16.800 --> 00:07:19.010
You're going to end up 
being treated like

00:07:19.010 --> 00:07:21.250
a little brother your 
entire life at this rate!

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:23.330
Is there a problem with that?

00:07:23.990 --> 00:07:26.410
You like being a little 
brother that much?!

00:07:26.410 --> 00:07:27.350
I don't like it.

00:07:27.350 --> 00:07:30.440
That should be enough for you!

00:07:30.440 --> 00:07:31.930
Don't be ridiculous.

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:32.790
Sou-kun.

00:07:32.790 --> 00:07:34.410
Telling Nanami-chan a secret?

00:07:34.410 --> 00:07:36.270
You should let me in on it, too.

00:07:37.860 --> 00:07:39.500
I'm not a kid anymore.

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:40.930
Just leave me alone!

00:07:40.930 --> 00:07:42.460
What?!

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:43.190
<b>Just leave me alone!</b>

00:07:44.340 --> 00:07:46.390
Oh, I know.

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:49.510
You're just embarrassed 
because other girls are here.

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:51.200
Silly boy.

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:53.530
It doesn't seem to have been effective!

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:55.070
The flag dodged it.

00:07:55.070 --> 00:07:56.740
Dodged it?

00:07:56.740 --> 00:07:59.060
Yeah, at mach speed.

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:01.460
<b>Tea club</b>

00:08:07.670 --> 00:08:08.520
A baby?

00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:11.470
Ryuukishibara Tsumugi, the Elder.

00:08:11.470 --> 00:08:14.860
It's said that she's been here since 
before the school was founded.

00:08:14.860 --> 00:08:17.370
She's in our class. 
Didn't you notice her?

00:08:17.370 --> 00:08:18.470
R-Right.

00:08:18.860 --> 00:08:23.520
But why... aren't you wearing a skirt?

00:08:23.820 --> 00:08:26.400
You don't know how to wear 
Japanese clothes properly?

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:28.230
Everyone's forgetting tradition 
because of the West.

00:08:28.450 --> 00:08:31.690
Anyway, can we do something 
about this, granny?

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:33.600
That'll be difficult.

00:08:33.600 --> 00:08:36.000
That building was constructed 
when the school was founded.

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:39.120
It's going to take some 
significant work to clean up.

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:42.760
The Japanese population is dropping, 
and we don't have a large budget—

00:08:42.760 --> 00:08:44.980
getting the place rebuilt 
is a tall order.

00:08:44.980 --> 00:08:46.880
Please do something for Sou-kun!

00:08:47.190 --> 00:08:50.270
Young'uns these days rely 
on others far too much!

00:08:51.600 --> 00:08:53.660
You should try to do something on your—

00:08:53.660 --> 00:08:57.010
I think that's enough nonsense 
for one day, granny!

00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:00.640
You call this "nonsense," Mimori?

00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:02.810
Don't come in here with shoes on, either.

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:04.960
You called for me,

00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:07.310
so you already had 
something in mind, right?

00:09:10.100 --> 00:09:11.810
Anyway, I'm here now.

00:09:12.110 --> 00:09:13.440
I'm the student council 
president you can depend on.

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:15.800
My name: Seiteikouji Mimori!

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:16.120
<b>Student Council President</b>

00:09:16.120 --> 00:09:17.610
Student council president?!

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:22.590
It'll be faster to just 
rebuild the whole thing.

00:09:22.590 --> 00:09:24.870
Leave it to me!

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:27.240
I've already called 
in the professionals.

00:09:27.240 --> 00:09:28.190
Professionals?

00:09:28.190 --> 00:09:31.100
Hatagaya Academy's Engineering 
Research Society.

00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:34.880
Why does the school even have 
an organization like that?!

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:35.970
<b>Takumi</b>

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:37.840
Engineering here!

00:09:37.050 --> 00:09:37.840
<b>Engineering Research Here!</b>

00:09:38.060 --> 00:09:40.500
I can see you wrecked another place.

00:09:40.500 --> 00:09:41.550
That's rude!

00:09:41.550 --> 00:09:42.720
It wasn't me this time!

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:45.470
How long will it take for you to fix this 
place up so he can live here?

00:09:45.470 --> 00:09:47.980
I'd like you to do something as 
soon as possible for Sou-kun here.

00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:51.290
It's going to take a 
month to do all of this.

00:09:51.290 --> 00:09:53.590
That might be different if we could 
get some more people on the project.

00:09:53.590 --> 00:09:55.220
Then will this work?

00:09:55.220 --> 00:09:55.490
Hm?

00:09:57.240 --> 00:09:59.200
You're living in this place?

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:00.660
If we'd only known sooner...

00:10:04.030 --> 00:10:06.960
I asked the class to help.

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:08.170
Good work, Akane!

00:10:08.630 --> 00:10:10.170
This'll be more than enough.

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:11.480
All right, guys!

00:10:11.480 --> 00:10:13.180
We're doing this in a week!

00:10:13.180 --> 00:10:14.540
Right!

00:10:14.540 --> 00:10:18.810
I'd like to thank you all 
for listening to my request.

00:10:19.110 --> 00:10:21.350
Thank you for helping Sou-kun!

00:10:23.740 --> 00:10:25.850
I guess I owe you all...

00:10:26.100 --> 00:10:27.100
Leave it to us!

00:10:29.530 --> 00:10:31.360
Aren't you glad, Souta-kun?

00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:33.720
It's all thanks to all 
of you, Akane, Okiku-nee.

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:36.650
<b>Akane's eye</b>

00:10:34.390 --> 00:10:36.100
It's all thanks to you, Akane.

00:10:39.150 --> 00:10:40.150
Wh-What's up?

00:10:40.150 --> 00:10:42.520
You've got a wonderful smile!

00:10:42.520 --> 00:10:43.310
What?!

00:10:44.380 --> 00:10:47.290
Just seeing it makes me so happy!

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:48.080
Jeez.

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:55.630
<b>Bliss</b>

00:10:48.760 --> 00:10:52.720
You're like a cake made 
out of bliss itself.

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:55.630
Poet-san

00:10:52.720 --> 00:10:55.190
Nanami-chan, you're a poet!

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:58.350
No!

00:10:58.350 --> 00:10:59.930
Way to go, Nanami-chan!

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:01.640
I'm coming, too!

00:11:01.830 --> 00:11:03.390
Me, too!

00:11:04.870 --> 00:11:07.140
Souta, was it?

00:11:07.410 --> 00:11:08.410
Granny?

00:11:08.410 --> 00:11:10.480
Remember this.

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:12.130
This isn't a favor.

00:11:12.130 --> 00:11:13.320
Everyone's doing it out of their hearts.

00:11:13.320 --> 00:11:15.130
You don't return goodwill with goodwill.

00:11:15.130 --> 00:11:17.160
You keep it in your heart.

00:11:17.160 --> 00:11:20.490
It will grow inside you, and change you,

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:24.270
and then one day you'll grow into

00:11:24.270 --> 00:11:27.330
a person that can have 
goodwill towards others.

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:28.720
Yeah.

00:11:37.820 --> 00:11:39.020
That's impressive.

00:11:39.020 --> 00:11:40.460
It's like a whole different place.

00:11:40.460 --> 00:11:42.130
Keep flattering me!

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:44.510
You didn't do a single thing, though.

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:46.900
We only have finishing 
touches left to make,

00:11:46.900 --> 00:11:48.470
so feel free to start moving in.

00:11:48.980 --> 00:11:50.270
Okay, everyone!

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:51.960
Time to finish this bad boy up!

00:11:51.960 --> 00:11:52.810
Right!

00:11:58.680 --> 00:12:00.700
I can't get this by myself.

00:12:02.600 --> 00:12:04.570
Sorry, could you help me here?

00:12:05.140 --> 00:12:06.880
I need a man to help me here.

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:10.260
Huh?

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:13.630
Me?

00:12:14.180 --> 00:12:15.890
I'm a boy?

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:18.710
Uh, I'm sorry if I was wrong.

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:21.470
No, you're right. I'm a guy.

00:12:23.320 --> 00:12:25.220
People always treat me like a girl.

00:12:25.710 --> 00:12:28.970
This is the first time someone thought 
I was a guy the first time we talked!

00:12:37.290 --> 00:12:40.000
<i>Th-These are friendship flags, right?</i>

00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:41.820
<i>How do I destroy these...</i>

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:44.320
<i>Wait... Can I even destroy these?</i>

00:12:44.760 --> 00:12:47.050
My name is Touzokuyama Megumu!

00:12:47.050 --> 00:12:48.590
Nice to meet you, Hatate-kun!

00:12:48.590 --> 00:12:50.380
You can call me Souta.

00:12:51.190 --> 00:12:52.330
Then you...

00:12:52.610 --> 00:12:55.270
You can call me Megumu, Souta-kun!

00:12:55.270 --> 00:12:58.790
You can tell men are friends when 
they call each other by name.

00:12:59.550 --> 00:13:00.940
Men, huh?

00:13:00.940 --> 00:13:03.200
Everyone in our class calls

00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:05.190
me Megu like I'm a girl.

00:13:05.190 --> 00:13:06.800
I-I see.

00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:09.560
So, what's up with that uniform, Megumu?

00:13:09.780 --> 00:13:12.670
Onee-chan said I look 
a lot cuter this way,

00:13:12.670 --> 00:13:15.310
and got approval from the school 
to have me dress this way...

00:13:15.310 --> 00:13:16.260
I see.

00:13:16.260 --> 00:13:17.690
I understand how you feel.

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:19.570
Your sister must be a tough cookie.

00:13:19.570 --> 00:13:20.530
Thank you!

00:13:20.530 --> 00:13:22.690
You're the only one who understands!

00:13:23.100 --> 00:13:25.570
<i>Why do you smell so good?</i>

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:26.700
<i>And your skin's so soft.</i>

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:30.080
Souta-kun, do you need some help—

00:13:30.720 --> 00:13:32.700
I-I'm sorry!

00:13:32.700 --> 00:13:34.990
I'll help you out!

00:13:34.990 --> 00:13:35.830
What are you going on about?!

00:13:36.150 --> 00:13:41.840
I always help couples find new partners!

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:43.210
Then you're not helping at all!

00:13:43.210 --> 00:13:44.750
No! No!

00:13:44.750 --> 00:13:47.220
We were just being friendly!

00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:48.580
How nice.

00:13:48.580 --> 00:13:49.920
I wish I could do that.

00:13:49.920 --> 00:13:52.470
Men and women can be great friends!

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:51.350
<b>Clench</b>

00:13:54.200 --> 00:13:56.230
Akane, Megumu is a boy!

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:57.610
Look at his uniform!

00:13:58.010 --> 00:14:00.110
Oh, I didn't notice.

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:01.420
Sorry about that.

00:14:01.420 --> 00:14:04.860
That's why I never saw Megu-chan 
with the girls in PE.

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:07.860
But everyone still calls me Megu...

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:09.150
Sou-kun...

00:14:09.740 --> 00:14:10.480
Hey!

00:14:10.480 --> 00:14:12.180
I take my eyes off of you for a second,

00:14:12.180 --> 00:14:13.870
and you're already with another girl.

00:14:14.280 --> 00:14:17.620
I... just don't know what to do!

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:21.750
Okiku-nee! Megumu isn't a girl!

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:23.480
Look he's wearing a men's uniform!

00:14:23.480 --> 00:14:24.630
I didn't notice!

00:14:24.950 --> 00:14:28.720
Sorry, but Megu-chan's always 
in the girls' bathroom.

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:29.960
H-Hey.

00:14:29.960 --> 00:14:33.470
When I go to the men's bathroom, 
everyone always gets uncomfortable.

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:37.050
So the girls are okay with 
me using the girls' bathroom.

00:14:37.050 --> 00:14:38.480
I-I see.

00:14:38.950 --> 00:14:40.660
So this is where you've been, Souta.

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:43.650
Hm? You couldn't find another guy?

00:14:46.930 --> 00:14:48.850
Well, this is a problem.

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:52.020
Hatate is the only one 
in this dorm, right?

00:14:52.020 --> 00:14:53.450
That's right. Why?

00:14:54.570 --> 00:14:57.710
According to the rules, any dorm with 
a single resident will be shut down.

00:14:57.710 --> 00:14:59.250
You tell us this now?!

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:02.080
Take away our careless 
student council president!

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:05.000
You need to have at least five people!

00:15:05.600 --> 00:15:07.760
Those are the rules!

00:15:07.990 --> 00:15:09.910
Mimori says that,

00:15:09.910 --> 00:15:12.520
but I'm sure you'll get five 
friends together in a hurry.

00:15:12.520 --> 00:15:14.160
That's a terrible rule.

00:15:14.160 --> 00:15:16.250
I can't trust her.

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:19.560
Even if you don't have any friends, 
you do have an "oneechan."

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:20.590
It's fine.

00:15:20.590 --> 00:15:22.030
I'm used to being alone.

00:15:22.030 --> 00:15:24.270
That's not good! You shouldn't be alone!

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:26.650
I-I'll move in here!

00:15:27.470 --> 00:15:29.060
This is a men's dorm, isn't it?

00:15:29.060 --> 00:15:30.240
It's an old dorm.

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:31.410
No need to worry about formalities.

00:15:31.710 --> 00:15:34.860
Yeah, but there can't just be two of us 
there... We're the opposite sex, and all.

00:15:34.860 --> 00:15:37.370
I'll move in here, then.

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:38.590
That's even worse!

00:15:38.590 --> 00:15:40.160
U-Um...

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:42.810
I-I want to move in too.

00:15:42.810 --> 00:15:43.670
You, too, Megumu?!

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:45.940
Three women and one man.

00:15:45.940 --> 00:15:47.170
That balances out well.

00:15:48.670 --> 00:15:51.160
Now we only need one more.

00:15:51.160 --> 00:15:53.790
Please not another girl.

00:15:55.550 --> 00:15:58.310
I don't know any men...

00:15:59.440 --> 00:16:01.190
Um, Nanami-chan is...

00:16:03.410 --> 00:16:05.890
Hey, it's just a joke, Nanami-chan.

00:16:05.890 --> 00:16:09.670
Sou-kun's good friends with you, Nanami. 
Of course you can come.

00:16:09.670 --> 00:16:12.700
I never said I wanted to live here!

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:14.720
If I don't get that corner room,

00:16:14.720 --> 00:16:17.040
I'm not moving in!

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:18.700
H-Hey, you can't just...

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:26.210
Well, I guess... it'll be fun.

00:16:27.930 --> 00:16:30.550
Not the black arts again!

00:16:33.660 --> 00:16:35.720
I said it'll be fun,

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:38.020
but why are we all gathering in my room?

00:16:38.020 --> 00:16:39.380
No choice.

00:16:39.380 --> 00:16:42.980
We all suddenly decided to move in, 
so you're the only one with any stuff.

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:44.630
Then you didn't have to move in today.

00:16:44.630 --> 00:16:46.720
No. Everything's going to end if

00:16:46.720 --> 00:16:49.410
we leave you alone for even a second.

00:16:49.410 --> 00:16:52.070
It's true I'm alone in the world, but...

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:55.740
It's my first time in a 
room of a male friend.

00:16:55.740 --> 00:16:57.470
I'm kind of nervous.

00:16:57.470 --> 00:17:00.830
It feels more like you've entered your 
boyfriend's room, not your friend's.

00:17:02.780 --> 00:17:04.760
If we're all going to live together,

00:17:04.760 --> 00:17:06.040
then we need to decide 
a bunch of things.

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:07.970
Like who's going to be in charge, 
or who's on duty for what.

00:17:07.970 --> 00:17:10.210
You've sure thought this through, Okiku-nee.

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:12.510
I am the "oneechan," after all!

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:15.010
But before that we need to take a bath.

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:17.850
<b>Girls are Bathing</b>

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:17.850
No Peeking

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:17.850
<b>Bath</b>

00:17:17.850 --> 00:17:19.930
That's nice.

00:17:20.150 --> 00:17:22.650
Yeah, but I wanted to 
get in with Sou-kun,

00:17:22.650 --> 00:17:24.060
like we used to do.

00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:26.150
You mean a really long time ago,

00:17:26.150 --> 00:17:28.940
when you were small, right?

00:17:28.940 --> 00:17:31.060
Oh, you jealous?

00:17:31.060 --> 00:17:34.750
If you're jealous, you can go 
ahead and call me "oneechan."

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:36.800
Did you finally fall 
for him, Nanami-chan?!

00:17:36.800 --> 00:17:39.370
You finally stopped being 
that weird "tsundere"?

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:41.450
What is that even supposed to mean?!

00:17:41.930 --> 00:17:44.960
Akane-chan, are you rooting 
for Sou-kun and Nanami-chan?

00:17:44.960 --> 00:17:46.420
I-I just want

00:17:47.020 --> 00:17:50.020
to make Souta-kun happy...

00:17:50.710 --> 00:17:53.300
Akane-chan, you're a nice girl.

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:56.510
You're a member of the 
"Make Sou-kun happy" alliance.

00:17:56.510 --> 00:17:58.850
What do members of that do?

00:17:58.850 --> 00:18:02.020
They watch Sou-kun be 
happy and feel good.

00:18:02.020 --> 00:18:04.020
Aren't we supposed to be 
the ones making him happy?!

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:07.160
Even Akane can't keep 
up with her craziness.

00:18:13.740 --> 00:18:15.070
<i>This is awkward...</i>

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:17.710
<i>I need to get a conversation 
going with Megumu.</i>

00:18:17.710 --> 00:18:18.240
Hm?

00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:19.450
<b>Men</b>

00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:19.450
Men!

00:18:19.450 --> 00:18:21.160
A-A "men" flag?!

00:18:22.540 --> 00:18:24.800
Souta-kun, we're going 
to look in the bath.

00:18:24.800 --> 00:18:25.080
Huh?

00:18:25.320 --> 00:18:29.000
We're going to go, 
walk straight in, and get an eyeful.

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:29.540
Now come.

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:31.540
W-Wait a second!

00:18:33.800 --> 00:18:35.240
You know,

00:18:35.240 --> 00:18:38.740
I'm pretty sure that 
real men wouldn't look.

00:18:38.740 --> 00:18:39.650
Crap!

00:18:39.650 --> 00:18:41.890
Souta-kun, don't look!

00:18:41.890 --> 00:18:43.550
It's not manly!

00:18:48.790 --> 00:18:50.230
<i>Okiku-nee!</i>

00:18:53.370 --> 00:18:54.330
<i>Akane!</i>

00:18:54.650 --> 00:18:56.650
<b>Keropon</b>

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:03.960
Why are you here?!

00:19:06.860 --> 00:19:09.330
Man, that hurt.

00:19:09.740 --> 00:19:12.140
That really sucked.

00:19:12.780 --> 00:19:13.340
Hm?

00:19:18.730 --> 00:19:19.660
That was...

00:19:42.320 --> 00:19:43.320
Hatate Souta

00:19:44.100 --> 00:19:45.140
<i>A letter?</i>

00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:51.430
What's this about?

00:19:54.470 --> 00:19:55.670
Oh well.

00:19:56.020 --> 00:19:59.170
I thought I'd be able to 
put up a better fight.

00:19:59.470 --> 00:20:01.470
The knight, magician,

00:20:01.470 --> 00:20:04.290
samurai, dragon knight, bishop,

00:20:04.290 --> 00:20:07.180
ninja, thief, summoner.

00:20:07.550 --> 00:20:09.180
The magician is troublesome.

00:20:09.710 --> 00:20:11.630
If possible, you should 
get rid of him first.

00:20:12.180 --> 00:20:13.940
You need the knight for protection.

00:20:14.370 --> 00:20:16.440
He will always follow the Royal Banner.

00:20:17.170 --> 00:20:20.690
The bishop acts as a decoy, and 
the ninja attacks from behind.

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:22.050
I get it.

00:20:22.050 --> 00:20:23.700
So that's what I should have done.

00:20:24.090 --> 00:20:26.950
Oniisan, you haven't forgotten 
your promise, have you?

00:20:27.540 --> 00:20:30.360
The person who loses will listen 
to whatever the winner says.

00:20:30.360 --> 00:20:31.340
Right?

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:34.330
I wonder you're going to tell me to do.

00:20:34.800 --> 00:20:36.470
I'm not going to tell 
you to do anything.

00:20:36.470 --> 00:20:37.640
I want to ask you for something.

00:20:37.940 --> 00:20:41.840
I didn't win because I was good.

00:20:42.140 --> 00:20:44.360
Above my head I have the "victor" flag,

00:20:44.360 --> 00:20:47.220
and above yours, you 
have the "defeat" flag.

00:20:47.220 --> 00:20:48.350
Flag?

00:20:48.350 --> 00:20:51.350
I will give you my power.

00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:53.710
And in exchange,

00:20:53.710 --> 00:20:56.480
you must learn the ultimate 
truth of this world.

00:20:57.140 --> 00:21:01.020
I wonder what answer you'll 
give when you find it...

00:21:01.020 --> 00:21:02.430
I'm excited.

00:21:02.730 --> 00:21:04.240
W-Wait!

00:21:04.530 --> 00:21:06.680
Sakura!

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:14.710
"Princess knight, magician, clergyman,

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:15.670
ninja..."

00:21:16.040 --> 00:21:16.710
Flags...

00:21:17.220 --> 00:21:19.000
The Premium Ambriel"...

00:21:19.570 --> 00:21:20.850
My forgotten "nee-san."

00:21:21.670 --> 00:21:22.670
Sakura...

00:21:23.470 --> 00:21:26.020
The ultimate truth of this world...

00:23:11.200 --> 00:23:12.680
Roar! Gawo!

00:23:12.680 --> 00:23:15.740
So we're having our athletic meet and I 
don't even remember having much class.

00:23:15.740 --> 00:23:19.880
I'm going to find the best 
place to film, for Sou-kun!

00:23:19.880 --> 00:23:22.840
Now you're acting more like a 
dad instead of an older sister!

00:23:22.840 --> 00:23:25.800
We're all going to get together 
and cheer for Souta-kun.

00:23:25.800 --> 00:23:29.800
Akane-chan is going to get me a great 
outfit that showcases just how manly I am.

00:23:29.800 --> 00:23:30.770
I think that's obviously

00:23:30.770 --> 00:23:31.940
the "cheerleader girl" flag.

00:23:31.390 --> 00:23:34.970
<b>Flag 3</b>

00:23:31.390 --> 00:23:34.970
<b>Leave it to Me,
There is a 99.9% Chance We're Going to Win This Athletic Meet</b>

00:23:31.940 --> 00:23:33.570
Roar! Gawo!

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.970
<b>If Her Flag Breaks</b>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.970
<b>I hope you watch us next time!</b>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.970
Illustration: Fujima Takuya
